<h3>Perturbation Step Size</h3>

<p><b>ONLY USED IN THE MAXIET ALGORITHM</b>

<p>Perturbation is the amount used to reduce the Maxwellian Temperature when searching for the best Maxwellian parameters

<p>
Max_Temperature = Max_Temperature - Perturbation

<p> 
After Max_Temperature is reduced less than Perturbation then Max_Temperature
is set to Initial_Max_Temperature+3*Perturbation. And the search continues.


